<title>USA: O.J. Simpson's house sold at auction.</title>
<headline>O.J. Simpson's house sold at auction.</headline>
<dateline>NORWALK, Calif. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>O.J. Simpson's mansion was sold at auction for $2,631,259 on Monday, but the proceeds were unlikely to go towards settling the $33.5 million court judgment against him.</p>
</text>
